+# Windows (wddm-mali-g52): libdrm is the shim in libpankmod, which drives the
+# Mali through maliwddm. Mesa builds the DRM syncobj support of the Vulkan
+# runtime only with a real libdrm, so the two files are built here, with
+# HAVE_LIBDRM, against the shim's xf86drm.h. panvk_win32.c has the log the
